Package: bonafide
Title: Interactive Powerlifting Performance Benchmarks
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Aryaman", "Dhindsa", email = "adhi0021@student.monash.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a prepared historical extract of OpenPowerlifting
    competition results, tools for comparing a three-lift performance with
    similar competitors, and an interactive Shiny application for exploring
    lift-specific and total-strength percentiles.
